# AssetGen environment variables.
#
# Copy this file to .env in the same directory (or your project root — bin/
# scripts look upward from cwd) and fill in real values. Never commit .env —
# it should already be in your project's .gitignore; if not, add it before
# filling this in.

# RunPod API key. Dashboard → Settings → API Keys → create a key with pod
# read/write scope. Required by bin/runpod.mjs and implicitly by
# bin/generate.mjs (which needs a pod already running to tunnel into).
RUNPOD_KEY=

# HuggingFace access token. Required for two gated repos:
#   - FLUX.2 [dev] fp8 image path (--model flux2 / --profile flux2) —
#     see docs/FLUX2_A100.md. Not needed for the default
#     dreamshaper/juggernaut image models (CivitAI-style direct links, not
#     gated HF repos).
#   - Stable Audio Open 1.0, the default (and only) audio model — see
#     docs/AUDIO.md. Needed for every audio generation run, not just an
#     opt-in path like FLUX.2 is on the image side.
#
# One token covers both — must belong to a HuggingFace account that has
# accepted the license on BOTH gated model pages:
#   https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-dev
#   https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-audio-open-1.0
# The token itself doesn't need special scopes beyond default read access,
# but requests 401 if the license hasn't been accepted on that account.
HF_TOKEN=
